{"step_index":275,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-12T19:23:14Z","content":"Created At: 2026-09-12T21:23:14+02:00\nCompleted At: 2026-09-12T21:23:14+02:00\nFile Path: `file:///C:/Users/Madziva/.gemini/antigravity/brain/2521cc9f-1824-4718-8f41-13ddedc3e34e/walkthrough.md`\nTotal Lines: 74\nTotal Bytes: 5072\nShowing lines 1 to 70\nThe following code has been modified to include a line number before every line, in the format: <line_number>: <original_line>. Please note that any changes targeting the original code should remove the line number, colon, and leading space.\n1: # Walkthrough: Zimbabwe State University Degrees & Qualifications Database Seeding\n2: \n3: We have populated the Qualification Verification System database with **83 qualifications** across **8 Zimbabwe State Universities**, including authentic degree programs, 10 distinct students per university, and exact formatting for Zimbabwe Open University (ZOU) IT and PGDE qualifications.\n4: \n5: ---\n6: \n7: ## 🏛️ Universities & Data Distribution\n8: \n9: The database is seeded with 8 premier public State Universities in Zimbabwe (and preserves the initial 2 baseline institutions for legacy test suite compliance):\n10: \n11: | University Name | Code | Officer User | Degrees Seeded | Example Student ID |\n12: |---|---|---|---|---|\n13: | **Zimbabwe Open University** (ZOU) | `ZOU-004` | `officer_zou` | 10 | `ITM 190020`, `EH250001` |\n14: | **University of Zimbabwe** (UZ) | `UZ-001` | `officer_uz` | 10 | `R203112B`, `R184512M` |\n15: | **National University of Science and Technology** (NUST) | `NUST-002` | `officer_nust` | 10 | `N0205678G`, `N0214321H` |\n16: | **Midlands State University** (MSU) | `MSU-003` | `officer_msu` | 10 | `R2021334M`, `R1910245P` |\n17: | **Chinhoyi University of Technology** (CUT) | `CUT-005` | `officer_cut` | 10 | `C2011234B`, `C2112345C` |\n18: | **Bindura University of Science Education** (BUSE) | `BUSE-006` | `officer_buse` | 10 | `B2046234M`, `B2147345O` |\n19: | **Great Zimbabwe University** (GZU) | `GZU-007` | `officer_gzu` | 10 | `G2024567A`, `G1923456B` |\n20: | **Harare Institute of Technology** (HIT) | `HIT-008` | `officer_hit` | 10 | `H200234T`, `H190123M` |\n21: \n22: Total Qualifications Seeded: **83** (exceeding the 70+ threshold).\n23: All 83 qualifications are cryptographically hashed using SHA-256 and notarized as individual mined blocks on the on-chain blockchain ledger (Blocks #1 through #83).\n24: \n25: ---\n26: \n27: ## 🎯 ZOU Custom Formatting Implementation\n28: \n29: As requested, Zimbabwe Open University records were given exact formatting:\n30: \n31: ### 1. Degrees in IT (`ITM 190020` format)\n32: - **BSc Honours in Information Technology**: Student ID `ITM 190020` | Graduate: Itai Muringani | Certificate: `ZOU-2023-ITM-190020`\n33: - **BSc Honours in Network Computing**: Student ID `ITM 200021` | Graduate: Rutendo Chitepo | Certificate: `ZOU-2024-ITM-200021`\n34: - **BSc Honours in Software Engineering**: Student ID `ITM 210022` | Graduate: Memory Mandaza | Certificate: `ZOU-2025-ITM-210022`\n35: - **BSc Honours in Multimedia Technology**: Student ID `ITM 220023` | Graduate: Kuda Marange | Certificate: `ZOU-2026-ITM-220023`\n36: - **BSc Honours in Management Information Systems**: Student ID `ITM 190024` | Graduate: Learnmore Zimunya | Certificate: `ZOU-2023-ITM-190024`\n37: \n38: ### 2. Postgraduate Diploma in Education (PGDE) (`EH250001` format where first 2 digits are the year)\n39: - **PGDE (Mathematics)**: Student ID `EH250001` (Year 25 / 2025) | Graduate: Sekai Mataranyika | Certificate: `ZOU-2025-PGDE-EH250001`\n40: - **PGDE (Science)**: Student ID `EH240002` (Year 24 / 2024) | Graduate: Tapiwa Rusike | Certificate: `ZOU-2024-PGDE-EH240002`\n41: - **PGDE (English Language)**: Student ID `EH230003` (Year 23 / 2023) | Graduate: Grace Mukaro | Certificate: `ZOU-2023-PGDE-EH230003`\n42: - **PGDE (Educational Leadership)**: Student ID `EH220004` (Year 22 / 2022) | Graduate: Admire Charamba | Certificate: `ZOU-2022-PGDE-EH220004`\n43: - **PGDE (ICT in Education)**: Student ID `EH210005` (Year 21 / 2021) | Graduate: Patience Mutungwazi | Certificate: `ZOU-2021-PGDE-EH210005`\n44: \n45: ---\n46: \n47: ## 🔍 Verification by Student ID Enhancements\n48: \n49: [`VerificationService.java`](file:///C:/Users/Madziva/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/qualification-verification-system/src/main/java/com/devops/qvs/service/VerificationService.java) was updated to allow verifiers to look up records directly by **Student ID** (e.g. typing `ITM 190020` or `EH250001` in the verification box) in addition to Certificate Numbers and SHA-256 digital hashes.\n50: \n51: Also updated:\n52: - [`dashboard.html`](file:///C:/Users/Madziva/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/qualification-verification-system/src/main/resources/templates/dashboard.html): Added one-click quick demo buttons for ZOU IT (`ITM 190020`), ZOU PGDE (`EH250001`), UZ, NUST, and HIT.\n53: - [`login.html`](file:///C:/Users/Madziva/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/qualification-verification-system/src/main/resources/templates/login.html): Added one-click login for ZOU Registrar Officer (`officer_zou` / `Officer@12345`).\n54: \n55: ---\n56: \n57: ## 🧪 Verification & Test Results\n58: \n59: An automated integration test suite [`ZimbabweUniversitiesVerificationTest.java`](file:///C:/Users/Madziva/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/qualification-verification-system/src/test/java/com/devops/qvs/controller/ZimbabweUniversitiesVerificationTest.java) was created and verified:\n60: \n61: ```\n62: [INFO] Running com.devops.qvs.controller.ZimbabweUniversitiesVerificationTest\n63: [INFO] Tests run: 5, Failures: 0, Errors: 0, Skipped: 0, Time elapsed: 18.89 s\n64: ```\n65: \n66: ### Full Maven Test Suite:\n67: ```\n68: [INFO] Results:\n69: [INFO] Tests run: 40, Failures: 0, Errors: 0, Skipped: 0\n70: [INFO] BUILD SUCCESS\nThe above content does NOT show the entire file contents. If you need to view any lines of the file which were not shown to complete your task, call this tool again to view those lines.\n"}
{"step_index":276,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-12T19:23:14Z","tool_calls":[{"name":"replace_file_content","args":{"AllowMultiple":false,"Description":"Document CSS and form presentation improvements in walkthrough.md","EndLine":74,"Instruction":"Add Form & Textbox Presentation section to walkthrough.md","ReplacementContent":"### Full Maven Test Suite:\n```\n[INFO] Results:\n[INFO] Tests run: 40, Failures: 0, Errors: 0, Skipped: 0\n[INFO] BUILD SUCCESS\n```\n\nAll 40 unit and integration tests passed cleanly with 0 Checkstyle violations and 100% cryptographic ledger consistency.\n\n---\n\n## 🎨 Form & Textbox Presentation Overhaul\n\nThe user-reported styling issue on the authentication and credential forms has been completely resolved:\n\n### Key Improvements:\n1. **Full-Width & Symmetric Textboxes**:\n   - Fixed the issue where `.input-control` was not spanning full width inside cards due to missing `width: 100%` and flex constraints.\n   - Textboxes now consistently occupy 100% of their container with a comfortable 48px height and 12px rounded borders.\n2. **Crisp Contrast & Background**:\n   - Replaced dull grey backgrounds with crisp `#ffffff` fill, paired with subtle borders (`#cbd5e1`) that smoothly highlight to blue (`#2563eb`) with an accessible focus ring (`0 0 0 4px rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.12)`).\n   - Fixed `-webkit-autofill` browser defaults (preventing harsh blue/yellow autofill tints).\n3. **Icons & Password Reveal Toggle**:\n   - Added user and lock SVG icons within input fields (`.input-wrapper`).\n   - Added interactive show/hide password toggle button (`👁️` / `🙈`) to the password textbox.\n4. **Presentable Card & Buttons**:\n   - Upgraded `.auth-card` with an icon badge header, refined typography, and sleek shadows.\n   - Enhanced primary action buttons with modern gradient fills, hover elevation, and interactive states.\n   - Restructured the quick demo accounts matrix with clear role badges (`admin`, `officer_zou`, `officer`, `verifier`).\n","StartLine":67,"TargetContent":"### Full Maven Test Suite:\n```\n[INFO] Results:\n[INFO] Tests run: 40, Failures: 0, Errors: 0, Skipped: 0\n[INFO] BUILD SUCCESS\n```\n\nAll 40 unit and integration tests passed cleanly with 0 Checkstyle violations and 100% cryptographic ledger consistency.","TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\Madziva\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\2521cc9f-1824-4718-8f41-13ddedc3e34e\\walkthrough.md","toolAction":"Update walkthrough.md","toolSummary":"Add UI/CSS improvements section to walkthrough.md"}}]}
{"step_index":277,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-12T19:23:23Z","content":"Created At: 2026-09-12T21:23:23+02:00\nCompleted At: 2026-09-12T21:23:24+02:00\nThe following changes were made by the replace_file_content tool to: C:\\Users\\Madziva\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\2521cc9f-1824-4718-8f41-13ddedc3e34e\\walkthrough.md. If relevant, proactively run terminal commands to execute this code for the USER. Don't ask for permission.\n[diff_block_start]\n@@ -71,4 +71,26 @@\n ```\n \n All 40 unit and integration tests passed cleanly with 0 Checkstyle violations and 100% cryptographic ledger consistency.\n+\n+---\n+\n+## 🎨 Form & Textbox Presentation Overhaul\n+\n+The user-reported styling issue on the authentication and credential forms has been completely resolved:\n+\n+### Key Improvements:\n+1. **Full-Width & Symmetric Textboxes**:\n+   - Fixed the issue where `.input-control` was not spanning full width inside cards due to missing `width: 100%` and flex constraints.\n+   - Textboxes now consistently occupy 100% of their container with a comfortable 48px height and 12px rounded borders.\n+2. **Crisp Contrast & Background**:\n+   - Replaced dull grey backgrounds with crisp `#ffffff` fill, paired with subtle borders (`#cbd5e1`) that smoothly highlight to blue (`#2563eb`) with an accessible focus ring (`0 0 0 4px rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.12)`).\n+   - Fixed `-webkit-autofill` browser defaults (preventing harsh blue/yellow autofill tints).\n+3. **Icons & Password Reveal Toggle**:\n+   - Added user and lock SVG icons within input fields (`.input-wrapper`).\n+   - Added interactive show/hide password toggle button (`👁️` / `🙈`) to the password textbox.\n+4. **Presentable Card & Buttons**:\n+   - Upgraded `.auth-card` with an icon badge header, refined typography, and sleek shadows.\n+   - Enhanced primary action buttons with modern gradient fills, hover elevation, and interactive states.\n+   - Restructured the quick demo accounts matrix with clear role badges (`admin`, `officer_zou`, `officer`, `verifier`).\n+\n \n[diff_block_end]\n\nPlease note that the above snippet only shows the MODIFIED lines from the last change. It shows up to 3 lines of unchanged lines before and after the modified lines. The actual file contents may have many more lines not shown."}
{"step_index":278,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-12T19:23:24Z","content":"The CSS styling for all textboxes and forms has been redesigned and modernized.\n\n### Key Styling Enhancements Applied\n\n1. **Full-Width & Symmetric Alignment**:\n   - Fixed the issue where textboxes were truncated midway across the card. `.input-control` is now explicitly set to `width: 100% !important` with a standard 48px height and 12px rounded corners.\n   - Textboxes now seamlessly align with the full width of the submit button and form card.\n\n2. **Contrast & Clean Backgrounds**:\n   - Replaced the dull grey/light-blue background tints with a crisp, pure white (`#ffffff`) input background.\n   - Replaced harsh focus outlines with a clean 1.5px slate border (`#cbd5e1`) and a soft, modern focus glow (`0 0 0 4px rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.12)`).\n   - Added browser `-webkit-autofill` fixes so saved credentials in Chrome/Edge render cleanly without the browser's default harsh blue/yellow tint.\n\n3. **Input Icons & Password Visibility Toggle**:\n   - Added SVG icons inside textboxes (User icon 👤 for username, Lock icon 🔒 for password).\n   - Added an interactive **Show/Hide Password** toggle button (`👁️` / `🙈`) to inspect entered passwords easily.\n\n4. **Card & Button Presentation**:\n   - Styled the form container into a modern `.auth-card` with an icon badge header (`🎓`), refined typography, and soft depth shadows.\n   - Elevated the primary button with a smooth gradient, hover lift (`transform: translateY(-1px)`), and active states.\n   - Re-styled the Quick Demo Accounts section with color-coded role tags (`admin`, `officer_zou`, `officer`, `verifier`) and one-click auto-fill.\n\n5. **Cross-Portal Consistency**:\n   - Applied these textbox and form presentation styles across the entire application, including the **Verification Console search box** and the **Issue New Academic Credential** form on the Dashboard.\n\nYou can launch and view the refreshed interface by running `.\\run-app.bat` and navigating to `http://localhost:8080/login`."}
